russia's war against ukraine has  apparently entered a new offensive with  long-range missiles striking cities far  away from the front lines one of the  worst strikes was on the city of venezia  southwest of kiev the capital where  nearly a dozen people were killed this  past week holly williams reports  the invasion began with terror  some feared that ukraine's capital kiev  would fall within days  as russian columns moved menacingly  towards the city  this apartment building was hit on the  morning of february 26th just two days  after the war started though  miraculously nobody was reported killed  and this is the same building today more  than four months later like ukraine  itself it's battle scarred but still  standing dental clinic some of the shops  downstairs have already reopened  and after fleeing kiev in the first days  of war  orlando chumacova decided to move back  into the building  she took us up to the 20th floor to  inspect the damage but no one died  olenna and her neighbours are raising  money to patch it up i'm sure that  we are very strong people we are very  strong  country  we are united  and we will win  in the end yes  we will win in the end russia's bloody  invasion has seen millions flee their  homes  its military is still seizing territory  in ukraine's east  and cities across the country have been  hit by strikes  but in many parts of ukraine people seem  determined to keep calm and carry on  as if living life to the full is in  itself an act of defiance  these burned out russian armored  vehicles are not on the front line but  on display in the centre of kiev  objects of curiosity for morning  commuters whose lives have gone back to  a semblance of normal  olena told us her country is simply  invincible we haven't another choice  you have no choice but to fight yes and  survive yes  yes  reporting on wars can be surreal at  times and ukraine is absolutely no  exception but from what we've seen here  over several months now this conflict  has helped clarify for many ukrainians  exactly what they want for their country  and it's also revealed their strength  and determination  adriana  holly williams thank you so much
 

